From bf565a758ad5a6a859dc5a45b0371cd481985286 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dixonSolutions <203963471+dixonSolutions@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:21:57 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 095/119] dt-bindings: clock: samsung: exynos9810: Add the
 remaining bring-up CMUs

Add the bindings and clock IDs for the Exynos9810 CMU blocks needed for
bring-up next to CMU_CHUB: TOP, APM, CMGP, PERIC0, PERIC1, PERIS, FSYS0,
DPU and G3D. The CMU_CHUB IDs are unchanged.

The clock names and the clock tree come from Samsung's CMUCAL tables for
S5E9810 (cmucal-sfr.c / cmucal-node.c in the downstream kernel), the
header is generated from them with tools/cal2clk.py in the gtactive3
bring-up repository.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../clock/samsung,exynos9810-clock.yaml       | 228 ++++++-
 .../dt-bindings/clock/samsung,exynos9810.h    | 560 +++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 775 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

